ication_that_cannot_be_generated\n\nDrop a buffered notification that cannot be generated","verified_at":"2026-10-24T17:34:32Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commits/ec6501b47d37cb93248ef1c952809ec6dab4bb3c","html_url":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commit/ec6501b47d37cb93248ef1c952809ec6dab4bb3c","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commits/ec6501b47d37cb93248ef1c952809ec6dab4bb3c/comments","author":{"login":"koic","id":13203,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13203?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic","html_url":"https://github.com/koic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"37270d6af5c4f4c7bdfafe947aa53c3dcb62f5c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commits/37270d6af5c4f4c7bdfafe947aa53c3dcb62f5c9","html_url":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commit/37270d6af5c4f4c7bdfafe947aa53c3dcb62f5c9"},{"sha":"89772bf123ba16749e68748544584b43e4aff2da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commits/89772bf123ba16749e68748544584b43e4aff2da","html_url":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commit/89772bf123ba16749e68748544584b43e4aff2da"}]},{"sha":"89772bf123ba16749e68748544584b43e4aff2da","node_id":"C_kwDOOArzItoAKDg5NzcyYmYxMjNiYTE2NzQ5ZTY4NzQ4NTQ0NTg0YjQzZTRhZmYyZGE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Koichi ITO","email":"koic.ito@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-22T22:17:32Z"},"committer":{"name":"Koichi ITO","email":"koic.ito@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-24T17:23:01Z"},"message":"Drop a buffered notification that cannot be generated\n\n## Motivation and Context\n\nOn the 2026-07-28 path the Streamable HTTP transport buffers the notifications a handler emits during a request\nand writes them as SSE frames ahead of the response once the handler returns. A notification holding a string\nthat is not valid UTF-8, such as log data a tool passed to `notify_log_message`, raised `JSON::GeneratorError`\nwhile the frames were written, and the whole exchange was answered with 500, losing the response the handler\nhad produced.\n\nThe transport now generates each notification when it is buffered. One that cannot be generated is reported to\nthe exception reporter and dropped as non-delivery (`false`), as the buffer already does past its cap, and\nthe other notifications and the response are written as before.\n\n## How Has This Been Tested?\n\n`test/mcp/server/transports/streamable_http_transport_test.rb`. Against the previous library the new test\nanswers 500.\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\nNone.","tree":{"sha":"6cad6e7c85e3c3750cb61743671901eeacfeecf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/git/trees/6cad6e7c85e3c3750cb61743671901eeacfeecf0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/git/commits/89772bf123ba16749e68748544584b43e4aff2da","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commits/89772bf123ba16749e68748544584b43e4aff2da","html_url":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commit/89772bf123ba16749e68748544584b43e4aff2da","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commits/89772bf123ba16749e68748544584b43e4aff2da/comments","author":{"login":"koic","id":13203,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13203?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic","html_url":"https://github.com/koic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"koic","id":13203,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjAz","avatar_url":"https://