Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-10-21T14:54:59Z"},"message":"Merge pull request #626 from koic/release_1_8_1\n\nRelease 1.8.1","tree":{"sha":"08f5c76867bf8a52d4e94b4122cc60bf71d2c17e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/git/trees/08f5c76867bf8a52d4e94b4122cc60bf71d2c17e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/git/commits/0e59bb4c513930112845434f328e90eb1ff67908","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq2NJDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAanQQAKrolSD0pB5DAYnahi85F/u4\nsGqjBapEz0pnPQBHTwOx/C7jQtBHMQGKUAUe4pLkL5PCG6hnqxDXUOaWt58oS4wM\nO44GAXw9vya4Fu0KXncRiqOZGFjWwcnfmTV0m5K6sxjWQEVesEbnfwKsAQ/KPpSl\nofFARIW5Y2QRqhCxZfWjHXFmO9jaMXH8viIZkqLdsPc7/20BnCrXyLhGlv/m8/pi\nZGoE1O/K+9YfJJ1xLHLJOBgeSvqo1E+n5IKphGmdBZ/pEZmUWO430KC62wZJD5Wo\ndlsrliQ4RZDW1kaVlY5QURz1+Ee5yN5l2k6G92FoEKCzv0ufXqaihZIXmvCXllfG\nwgpU2bfjQfBu2CTJMzRNNj5fsn9TsUXXRTKHgHY2f7JTuk15oC+ctZ6dVIE3KEV4\n4Z5QrC6vHvT+dWw8YX+/BRjzbg/A4ksjVDCINUTJjQgAf2cRaYM2ZR/UAyN178HU\nREcQbYStseP5mqb5jaF9BRW2ubQPxGMZXg1E7vdpJFFONexYieGDNGjEAgku3g6V\nYZaP47h/D8mKQsBy9ei1vkMCeZbRb7YghzU6KHp+uM0MgXIqCCojam2y/1cZXiIz\ngssqDvwoEAq89d500JjaHHU2kOXDLQZ9Ocz38VFRu5bCfE+Nn/jYfnbU4ZDMd3/9\neX0Ugtmgh/pxtOvCKWdf\n=4Fvu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 08f5c76867bf8a52d4e94b4122cc60bf71d2c17e\nparent 9e2b3f7c1f8e3a0ff2e62a0bb5126898b26a1a68\nparent 0b3f02d8de54f22c48ca2aa94eb073656b28b434\nauthor Koichi ITO <koic.ito@gmail.com> 1792594499 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792594499 +0700\n\nMerge pull request #626 from koic/release_1_8_1\n\nRelease 1.8.1","verified_at":"2026-10-21T14:55:00Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commits/0e59bb4c513930112845434f328e90eb1ff67908","html_url":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commit/0e59bb4c513930112845434f328e90eb1ff67908","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commits/0e59bb4c513930112845434f328e90eb1ff67908/comments","author":{"login":"koic","id":13203,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13203?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic","html_url":"https://github.com/koic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"9e2b3f7c1f8e3a0ff2e62a0bb5126898b26a1a68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commits/9e2b3f7c1f8e3a0ff2e62a0bb5126898b26a1a68","html_url":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commit/9e2b3f7c1f8e3a0ff2e62a0bb5126898b26a1a68"},{"sha":"0b3f02d8de54f22c48ca2aa94eb073656b28b434","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commits/0b3f02d8de54f22c48ca2aa94eb073656b28b434","html_url":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commit/0b3f02d8de54f22c48ca2aa94eb073656b28b434"}]},{"sha":"0b3f02d8de54f22c48ca2aa94eb073656b28b434","node_id":"C_kwDOOArzItoAKDBiM2YwMmQ4ZGU1NGYyMmM0OGNhMmFhOTRlYjA3MzY1NmIyOGI0MzQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Koichi ITO","email":"koic.ito@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-20T21:58:13Z"},"committer":{"name":"Koichi ITO","email":"koic.ito@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-20T22:00:07Z"},"message":"Release 1.8.1\n\nThis release brings the server's JSON-RPC framing and capability advertisement, and the HTTP client's handling of\nan `initialize` answered over SSE, in line with the MCP specification. Several answers change on the wire,\nas fixes of incorrect conformance under the exceptions described in VERSIONING.md: a request whose id is null\nis refused with `-32600` instead of being run, and a request method sent without an id is not run; an error response\nwhose request id cannot be read carries no `id` member instead of `\"id\": null`; a stateless Streamable HTTP server\nno longer advertises `listChanged` or `subscribe` in `initialize`, since it cannot deliver those notifications,\nso clients refresh their lists on their own there; and the HTTP client returns from `initialize` as soon as\nits result arrives and raises `RequestHandlerError` on a 4xx or 5xx answer with an SSE body instead of returning\nthe error event. Senders of null ids and code that read such error events have to change; nothing else needs migration.\nA stdio server also survives a frame it cannot strip, parse or answer.","tree":{"sha":"08f5c76867bf8a52d4e94b4122cc60bf71d2c17e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/git/trees/08f5c76867bf8a52d4e94b4122cc60bf71d2c17e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/git/commits/0b3f02d8de54f22c48ca2aa94eb073656b28b434","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commits/0b3f02d8de54f22c48ca2aa94eb073656b28b434","html_url":"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commit/0b3f02d8de54f22c48ca2aa94eb073656b28b434","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commits/0b3f02d8de54f22c48ca2aa94eb073656b28b434/comments","author":{"login":"koic","id":13203,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13203?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic","html_url":"https://github.com/koic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"koic","id":13203,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13203?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic","html_url":"https://github.com/koic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/koic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https